WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
Isn't it over early?

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000
I just said that I'm not in a good state lately.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
The symptoms of those currently hospitalized are very obvious

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Have you had any similar problems after drinking it for a long time?

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
It can basically be judged that they are not the same batch of coffee. Sorry.

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Excuse me today

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
At present, it seems that there are indeed other situations

8
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,470
No need to stay overnight for now

9
00:00:18,470 --> 00:00:21,820
But we need to take this batch of coffee back for ingredient testing.

10
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:22,820
No problem

11
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:23,820
We ourselves are victims

12
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:27,720
Someone really used fake goods to put our name on it

13
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:37,140
I also want to know who the brother is

14
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:38,140
Yangfeng has run away

15
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:42,220
Where can we find a human god?
